+# Auth Service
+
+A simple authentication service with password hashing and JWT tokens.
+
+## Features
+
+- Secure password hashing with bcrypt
+- JWT-based authentication
+- Express middleware for protected routes
+- User login endpoint
+
+## Setup
+
+```bash
+npm install
+npm run start
+```
+
+## API
+
+POST /login - Login with email and password
